        <footnote id="F1">The option grant was approved by a committee of the Issuer's board of directors on December 23, 2025, subject to shareholder approval of an amendment to the Issuer's 2018 Equity Incentive Plan under which the option was granted. The Issuer's shareholders approved the amendment on June 5, 2026.</footnote>
